Modified by Udit in 2026: renamed and repackaged as AI Companion, with a new
human-like behaviour layer (chat, body language, pathfinding, house building and
storage, mining staircase and strip mining, food farm, building from schematics, combat
and survival reflexes)
and a port to Minecraft 26.3.

The bundled medieval starter houses (src/main/resources/assets/ai-companion/schematics/medieval_house_*.nbt) are
split from a medieval village design by ajmed.

The bundled iron farm design (src/main/resources/assets/ai-companion/schematics/iron_farm.nbt) is by
F3deMatt25.

The bundled town temple (src/main/resources/assets/ai-companion/schematics/town_temple.nbt) is by iSthz (an
offering chest added, empty space set to air). The bundled PvP arena (town_arena.nbt) was supplied by Udit
(author not recorded in the file; the natural ground it was saved with was removed).

The language models used by the chat intent system are downloaded at first launch
from the original AI-Player release assets.
